  "steps": [
    "Soak the beans about 12 hours, drain, and cook separately in fresh water until tender.",
    "Brown the mushrooms in oil in a large pot and set aside.",
    "Brown the onions in the same pot, fry the tomato paste, then briefly cook the lentils and miso.",
    "Deglaze with the beer, top up with water and add the seasonings, three-quarters of the garlic and the ham rind.",
    "Simmer until the lentils start to soften, then add the diced ham, mushrooms and chopped vegetables.",
    "Add the remaining garlic for the last half hour, and the beans toward the end.",
    "Adjust the seasoning and finish with parsley. Serve with flatbread."
